    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="en-US"><![CDATA[Enter with merciful hearts. Exit with battle cries.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="fr-FR"><![CDATA[Entrez, le cœur plein de pitié. Sortez, un cri de bataille dans la gorge.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="es-ES"><![CDATA[Únete con un corazón piadoso. Regresa con un grito de batalla.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="de-DE"><![CDATA[Tritt ein, zögere nicht! Keine Zeit für Gnade, sei bereit für den Krieg!]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="it-IT"><![CDATA[Entrate con cuori misericordiosi. Uscite con un grido di battaglia possente.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="jp-JA"><![CDATA[慈悲の心で入れ。喊声をあげて出よ。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ko-KR"><![CDATA[자비로운 마음을 가진 자들이 들어와 파죽지세의 군대가 되어 나갈 것이다.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ru-RU"><![CDATA[Войдите с чутким сердцем. Выйдите с боевым кличем на устах.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="pt-BR"><![CDATA[Entrem com corações piedosos. Saiam com gritos de guerra.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-CN"><![CDATA[此门前来时尚存慈悲胸怀，归去时锻出响亮战嚎。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-HK"><![CDATA[此門前來時尚存慈悲胸懷，歸去時鍛出響亮戰嚎。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
  </FLAVOURTEXT>
